# vwf scratch — mockup renders for visual review, never part of the contract
docs/scratchpad/

# vwf memory — the rooms that hold one developer's session state, not the team's
docs/memory/handoff/
docs/memory/doctor/
docs/memory/runs/

# code-intelligence graph — rebuilt locally, never committed
graphify-out/


